[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4020111023","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116905#issuecomment-4020111023","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116905","id":4020111023,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vngav","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-08T22:04:30Z","updated_at":"2026-03-08T22:05:31Z","body":"Resolving the issues required some _more radical_ changes, because the old code was an irredeemable mess (and I didn't even include all improvements, I'll probably do follow-ups). See OP for the summary of changes. Likely needs testing. I did test it and scene opening/closing/reloading/changing/soft reloading/etc is working, but maybe I missed some edge case.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4020111023/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4121699157","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116905#issuecomment-4121699157","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116905","id":4121699157,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71rCNV","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-24T22:04:04Z","updated_at":"2026-03-24T22:04:04Z","body":"I have tested the PR extensively, both manually and with a monkey tester. It fixes the issue and it seems to have significantly improved reloading stability as well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4121699157/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4122809784","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116905#issuecomment-4122809784","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116905","id":4122809784,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71vRW4","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-25T03:04:42Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T03:23:01Z","body":"An issue that I found in additional testing:\r\n\r\nIf we call `open_scene_from_path` on a scene that is _already open but is not currently in focus_, and then call `close_scene()` on it on the same frame (which is enabled by this PR now), we cause a segfault on the next frame. I can reproduce this consistently.\r\n\r\nThis is due to the [deferred call to `Tree::scroll_to_item` in `SceneTreeEditor::_update_filter_helper()`](https://github.com/nikitalita/godot/blob/938a20e4fe719ce562bb87d8267e65e697555c7d/editor/scene/scene_tree_editor.cpp#L1135)\r\n\r\nBasically:\r\nOpen the scene -> SceneTreeEditor updates selection and scrolls to the first node TreeItem -> close scene -> SceneTreeEditor clears tree, freeing that TreeItem -> next frame, the call deferred crashes because the TreeItem parameter has been freed.\r\n\r\nStack trace up to that deferred call from `open_scene_from_path()`:\r\n```\r\nSceneTreeEditor::_update_filter_helper(TreeItem*, bool, TreeItem*&) (/Users/nikita/Workspace/godot-ws/godot-pw/editor/scene/scene_tree_editor.cpp:1135)\r\nSceneTreeEditor::_update_filter(TreeItem*, bool) (/Users/nikita/Workspace/godot-ws/godot-pw/editor/scene/scene_tree_editor.cpp:995)\r\nSceneTreeEditor::set_filter(String const&) (/Users/nikita/Workspace/godot-ws/godot-pw/editor/scene/scene_tree_editor.cpp:1732)\r\nSceneTreeDock::set_filter(String const&) (/Users/nikita/Workspace/godot-ws/godot-pw/editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp:4235)\r\nEditorNode::_set_main_scene_state(Dictionary const&) (/Users/nikita/Workspace/godot-ws/godot-pw/editor/editor_node.cpp:4580)\r\nEditorNode::_set_current_scene_nocheck(int, bool) (/Users/nikita/Workspace/godot-ws/godot-pw/editor/editor_node.cpp:4666)\r\nEditorNode::_set_current_scene(int) (/Users/nikita/Workspace/godot-ws/godot-pw/editor/editor_node.cpp:4612)\r\nEditorNode::open_scene(String const&, bool, bool, bool) (/Users/nikita/Workspace/godot-ws/godot-pw/editor/editor_node.cpp:4855)\r\nEditorInterface::open_scene_from_path(String const&, bool) (/Users/nikita/Workspace/godot-ws/godot-pw/editor/editor_interface.cpp:715)\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4122809784/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4144797235","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116905#issuecomment-4144797235","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116905","id":4144797235,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73DJYz","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-27T19:32:45Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T19:33:33Z","body":"I can't reliably reproduce the crash. Does wrapping the item in Variant fix it for you?\r\n```c++\r\ncallable_mp(tree, &Tree::scroll_to_item).call_deferred(Variant(p_parent), false);\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4144797235/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4199999974","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116905#issuecomment-4199999974","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116905","id":4199999974,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc76Vunm","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nik